Third-party licenses
====================
fman could not have been developed without several pieces of open source
software. Here we describe which open source software is being used, and under
which terms.

Some open source licenses such as the GNU Lesser General Public License require
that we make the source code for the software used under the respective license
available to you. If you would like to receive a copy of such source code,
please send an email to michael@herrmann.io.

